{"chapter": "stacks-properties", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "04XB", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$P$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:2830a049a7193d5721b9f1d9ebedb741b3bac5a79a066e6636031086419518c6", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:72544530a69dbd1a04607d2b2605791db8e760480c048ee5ef7e69a31d4e9ba6", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nThe following lemma tells us it suffices to check <MATH_0001>\nafter a base change by a surjective, flat, locally finitely presented\nmorphism.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:116722c5b4d173506f069380a850115ee0edac1018a1f8e8d3971e859a74e98b", "unit_id": "tag:04XB:prose-0003"}
